      "message": "right now, they don\u0027t need this. but they\u0027ll need it when it comes to having the hack in \u003csys/user.h\u003e --- at that point all _users_ of bionic will need this. (though i do wonder if it should be _more_ global even than this in that case, because it wouldn\u0027t just be _host_ bionic.)",
