      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e For 4k targets, PAGE_SIZE will have the value 4096. For page size agnostic targets, PAGE_SIZE will have the function call getpagesize().\n\nwell, i assume assume you literally wouldn\u0027t set PAGE_SIZE _at all_ --- hence the name. (that\u0027s what glibc/musl and Apple\u0027s libc do.)",
      "parentUuid": "578ffb15_729a480d",
